c QIF benchmark 1/7: 1-bit secret equality (minimum leak example).
c
c Vars: 1 = h (secret), 2 = l (observable).
c Logic: l <-> (h == 0). Models: (h=0,l=1), (h=1,l=0). 2 models total.
c Leakage: 1 bit (full disclosure of a 1-bit secret).
c
c Reference: Smith G., "On the Foundations of Quantitative Information
c Flow", FoSSaCS 2009 — canonical 1-bit channel example used to
c illustrate min-entropy leakage L(X;Y) = log2(|X|/|X|Y=y|).
p cnf 2 2
-1 -2 0
1 2 0
